urriscaldamento ha reso la Terra una landa desolata e inabitabile. Un gruppo di amici batte le montagne alla ricerca di acqua e cibo, ma si trova a dover combattere una terribile battaglia per la sopravvivenza.","tagline":"Ciò che ci ha dato il nostro inizio, ci porterà alla nostra fine."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 2016 the sun has turned the entire world into a scorched and barren wasteland. The humans who have survived are either resourceful or violent, and sometimes both. Marie, her little sister Leonie, and best friend Phillip, are in a car headed to the mountains - rumor has it there is water there. Along the way they meet Tom, a first-rate mechanic. But can they trust him? Fraught with deep distrust, the group is lured into an ambush where their real battle for survival begins.","tagline":"What gave us our beginning, will lead to our end."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Seitdem die Strahlkraft der Sonne zugenommen hat, ist die Erde ein verdörrter, mörderischer Ort geworden. Nur wenige Überlebende sind verblieben, die sich notdürftig gegen die Sonnenstrahlen schützen und deren Leben von der Suche nach Wasser und Benzin bestimmt ist. Dazu gehört die Zweckgemeinschaft von Phillip und den Schwestern Marie und Leonie. Auf dem Weg in die Berge, wo es angeblich Leben geben soll, lesen sie Tom auf, ohne sich sicher sein zu können, dass er ihnen wohlgesonnen ist. Als sie in einen Hinterhalt geraten, beginnt der Kampf.","tagline":"Die Sonne wird Euch verbrennen"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fV97pxlmMfWPMSsYumj6Yghgi62.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hYJOPAcO60cSNaWqzE815PgdsTz.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":73262,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/o